    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Millets such as ragi, bajra, jowar and foxtail millet are nutrition-rich cereals. They have fibre, minerals and need less water to grow.\nFood miles are the distance food travels from farm to plate. Food from nearby has fewer food miles, stays fresher and uses less fuel.\nChoosing local and seasonal foods is good for health and the environment."
    }
